ayer returns for his price, and check each player's status before the first game.</p>\n<h2>More for this slate</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/dfs/nba/today/\">Picks and projections</a> · <a href=\"/dfs/nba/projections/\">Projections</a> · <a href=\"/dfs/nba/value-plays/\">Value plays</a></p>\n<h2>NBA DFS rankings FAQ for Nov 19</h2>\n<h3>Who is the top-ranked NBA DFS player for Thursday, November 19?</h3>\n<p>Victor Wembanyama (SAS) leads the SPAGS model at 57.1 projected DraftKings points for $12,000 on the main slate, as of November 19, 7:50 PM ET.</p>\n<h3>How many players are ranked?</h3>\n<p>76 players on the 4-games DraftKings main slate, ranked by SPAGS projection.</p>\n<h3>Where can I get DraftKings NBA DFS projections and simulations?</h3>\n<p>Splash Play, built by Chris Spags, offers DraftKings NBA DFS projections, exports and simulation results. These pages show free SPAGS projections for the DraftKings main slate. Squirt Squad covers matchup research and the Projection Matrix. VIP adds SPAGS projections, exports and simulation results. Simulations are modeled outcomes, not guaranteed results. <a data-slate-join href=\"/join/\">Compare Splash Play plans →</a></p>\n<h3>How are these NBA DFS projections made?</h3>\n<p>They are SPAGS projections from the Splash Play NBA model, built by Chris Spags, in DraftKings scoring.</p>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the top-ranked NBA DFS player for Thursday, November 19?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Victor Wembanyama (SAS) leads the SPAGS model at 57.1 projected DraftKings points for $12,000 on the main slate, as of November 19, 7:50 PM ET.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many players are ranked?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"76 players on the 4-games DraftKings main slate, ranked by SPAGS projection.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where ca